th"'::jsonb, '"Use projection construction/auxiliary views or successive rotations as required"'::jsonb, '"Third"'::jsonb, '"Second"'::jsonb, '"Fourth"'::jsonb, '"First"'::jsonb, '"Right-side view always"'::jsonb, '"Front view"'::jsonb, '"Only an isometric drawing"'::jsonb, '"Top view/plan"'::jsonb, '"Concentric-circle ellipse method only"'::jsonb, '"Isometric scale method"'::jsonb, '"Rectangle method or method of tangents (triangle method)"'::jsonb, '"Involute method"'::jsonb, '"On HP and in front of VP"'::jsonb, '"Below HP and behind VP"'::jsonb, '"Above HP and in front of VP"'::jsonb, '"Above HP and behind VP"'::jsonb, '"Sectional view"'::jsonb, '"Scale bar"'::jsonb, '"Centre line only"'::jsonb, '"Unsectioned isometric view only"'::jsonb, '"Use centre lines as outlines"'::jsonb, '"Use continuous thick object lines for visible edges and dashed lines for hidden edges"'::jsonb, '"Use dimensions for every edge"'::jsonb, '"Remove all line distinctions"'::jsonb, '"They meet only at a focus"'::jsonb, '"Both must be centre lines"'::jsonb, '"They are perpendicular at that point"'::jsonb, '"They are parallel"'::jsonb, '"Concentric-circle ellipse method only"'::jsonb, '"Cycloid rolling method"'::jsonb, '"Third-angle projection"'::jsonb, '"Focus-directrix method"'::jsonb, '"Top view on HP only"'::jsonb, '"Title block"'::jsonb, '"Front elevation on VP"'::jsonb, '"Section hatch"'::jsonb, '"Rectangular hyperbola"'::jsonb, '"Epicycloid"'::jsonb, '"Hypocycloid"'::jsonb, '"Cycloid"'::jsonb, '"The method turns all lines into hidden lines"'::jsonb, '"The circles have unrelated centres"'::jsonb, '"The method only constructs a cycloid"'::jsonb, '"Corresponding radial divisions and projected points locate points on the ellipse"'::jsonb, '"750 mm"'::jsonb, '"15 mm"'::jsonb, '"30 mm"'::jsonb, '"75 mm"'::jsonb, '"Plan below front view, right-side view left"'::jsonb, '"Plan below title block regardless of elevation"'::jsonb, '"All views stacked without alignment"'::jsonb, '"Plan above fron