INSERT INTO public."TestsData" ("TestId", "Questions", "Options", "Answers") VALUES (4600916401010125, ARRAY['"[8 marks] Explain Students learn how self-improvement enables them to secure a bright future for thems in the context of Remaking Yourself Restructuring Yourself. Define it, describe the main principles or steps, and give a relevant example."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain Students will undergo a study of how habits work in the context of Remaking Yourself Power of Habit. Define it, describe the main principles or steps, and give a relevant example."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain Students will learn from the inspirational lives of India''s two legends in the context of Learning from Legends- Tendulkar & Tata. Define it, describe the main principles or steps, and give a relevant example."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain Active listening is an essential part of academic progress and communications. Stude in the context of From House to Home Listening & Understanding. Define it, describe the main principles or steps, and give a relevant example."'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY[]::jsonb[], ARRAY['"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning/purpose (2 marks):** Students learn how self-improvement enables them to secure a bright future for thems is covered in “Remaking Yourself Restructuring Yourself”. A good answer should define its purpose, explain its main components or steps, connect it to Students learn how self-improvement enables them to secure a bright future for themselves. They will learn 6 powerful thought- processes that can develop their intellectual, physical, emotional, and spiritual quotients., provide a practical example and state how the result can be checked.\n\n**Principles/steps (3 marks):** Explain the concept in logical order and relate it to syllabus areas such as Students learn how self-improvement enables them to secure a bright future for themselves. They will learn 6 powerful thought- processes that can develop their intellectual; physical; emotional; an